WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.627 --> 00:00:13.337
You know, it start raining.

00:00:15.339 --> 00:00:17.717
And it can get really tricky for sure.

00:00:17.925 --> 00:00:20.011
Like it can get really, really tricky.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.639
And sometimes I need to go rescue people
because they get stuck

00:00:23.639 --> 00:00:28.019
then they start kind of backing up
and then they go out over the edge.

00:00:29.979 --> 00:00:30.980
I don't see anyone yet.

00:00:34.275 --> 00:00:35.985
It’s just dumping rain,

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:39.864
which is now going to impact the road
and how the guests get here.

00:00:41.324 --> 00:00:44.410
At my restaurant
the biggest challenge for the guests

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.329
coming, is really traffic.

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:49.332
Not actually
if a road is going to be stable enough

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:52.084
to get a car to my restaurant.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:56.422
But then Rolando tells me
they're not actually coming in a car.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:04.013
I ordered some military bus
that they use to go to the top

00:01:04.013 --> 00:01:05.097
of the volcano

00:01:11.312 --> 00:01:13.272
Yeah.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.443
Rolando seems to be just fine.

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:20.696
He's laughing about it, saying, “Ah
it'll be fine.

00:01:20.696 --> 00:01:22.573
We'll just put 30 people in a party bus.

00:01:22.573 --> 00:01:24.200
We'll truck them up this hill”.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.162
He seems to be going with the flow
in more ways than one here.

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:31.082
If he's not worried, I'm
going to try not to be worried.

00:01:42.927 --> 00:01:43.469
Oh, now they're coming?

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:44.262
Down the hill.

00:01:44.262 --> 00:01:45.137
Uh-oh.

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:50.935
We may get some grumpy faces...

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:53.896
So I think that's good.

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:55.064
Are they walking?

00:01:55.064 --> 00:01:55.815
Ah walking.

00:01:57.525 --> 00:02:00.570
Ah [bleep]
and they’re like in nice clothes.

00:02:01.445 --> 00:02:05.575
Yes, this restaurant is remote
and getting there is half the adventure.

00:02:05.908 --> 00:02:09.954
But Charlie Collins is a very important
chef, and trekking through the mud

00:02:09.954 --> 00:02:14.208
for this meal isn't the best way
to create a first impression.

